want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":497.98879099999976,"totalMs":497.99754100000064,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":527.1390839999985,"totalMs":527.1463340000009,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":513.4730830000008,"totalMs":513.4818750000013,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":527.242083000001,"totalMs":527.250333,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":791.1705829999992,"totalMs":949.6666670000013,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The last clip is C0009.MP4. However, I don't have a tool to delete files from the card. You'll need to delete it manually from your computer after downloading.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":5},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":1524.9179999999978,"totalMs":1524.9301659999983,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":69,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Battery is at 80%.","calls":[],"decisionMs":528.7546659999971,"totalMs":528.7617499999978,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"ISO lowered to 1250 to make the image a bit darker.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.33,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1016.1330830000006,"totalMs":1360.3797909999994,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":61,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":815.0805419999997,"totalMs":1001.5527089999996,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":33,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":563.4724580000002,"totalMs":563.4799579999999,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":567.9929589999992,"totalMs":568.0006670000002,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":584.7505830000009,"totalMs":584.7594170000011,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. No changes needed.","calls":[],"decisionMs":579.7048329999998,"totalMs":579.7134579999984,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":8,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":877.1339169999992,"totalMs":1098.7492079999975,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; no